"to subtract Carnegie Mellon University and its manufactures and distributors"
" from all liability for any claim for compensation. Carnegie Mellon "
"University and its manufactures and distributors entire liability and your "
"exclusive remedy shall be at Carnegie Mellon University's and its "
"manufactures and distributors option for the return of the price paid for, "
"or repair, or replacement of the CMUcam2. Carnegie Mellon University and its"
" manufactures and distributors disclaim all other warranties, either "
"expressed or implied, including, but not limited to, the implied warranties "
"of merchantability and fitness for a particular purpose, with respect to the"
" CMUcam2 including accompanying written material, hardware and firmware."
